{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111397","id":2896297290,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sof1K","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111397","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111397.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111397.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111397","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111397/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111397/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111397/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/88e2db155a3a8add854a9e487425409f4203059c","number":111397,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Return correctly typed arrays for dict's keys() and values() methods","user":{"login":"ultsi","id":6347200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDcyMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6347200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi","html_url":"https://github.com/ultsi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This change modifies `gdscript_analyzer.cpp` to update the return type of dictionaries `keys()` and `values()` methods so that they return correctly typed arrays.\r\n\r\nRegarding the approach to solve the problem, I collaborated with @StarryWorm in chat and seems like whilst this is a bit hacky, it could be ok since this solves a gdscript-only issue. Solving it in a smarter way would require a bigger refactor in core like many have pointed out in the linked issues.\r\n\r\nP.s. This is my first contribution, feel free to nitpick and suggest changes, here to learn. \r\n\r\nRelated issues: \r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59721\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111107\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10804\r\n\r\nNote: this PR previously tried to fix element returning methods returning Variant as well, which wasn't correct as dalexeev explained below. This PR is now only focused on returning correctly typed arrays for the aforementioned dictionary methods. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/t